OL,3,GNEWSAJury deliberating in Matthew
OL,4,AWeller murder trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FJurors have retired to consider whether
OL,7,Fa Lancashire driver who admits killing
OL,8,Fa man with his car is guilty of murder.
OL,10,FMuhammed Haarith, 23, pleaded guilty to
OL,11,Fthe manslaughter of 44-year-old Matthew
OL,12,FWeller, who was struck by a VW Passat
OL,13,Fin Accrington town centre after 22:00
OL,14,FBST on 22 April.
OL,16,FThe jury at Preston Crown Court must
OL,17,Fdecide whether Haarith intended to kill
OL,18,FWeller or cause him really serious harm
OL,19,Fduring the incident, making him guilty
OL,20,Fof murder.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
